    "q-81055": {
      "dom_id": "step-q81055",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(P∨Q)∧R?$",
      "worked_solution": "We distribute the conjunction over the disjunction, as follows:\n\n$$\n(P∨Q)∧R≡(P∧R)∨(Q∧R)\n$$\n\nNow, since $Q∧R≡R∧Q,$ we can write\n\n$$\n(P∧R)∨(Q∧R)≡(P∧R)∨(R∧Q).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
