    "q-81616": {
      "dom_id": "step-q81616",
      "name": "Question 11",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(X∧Y)∨(X∧¬Z)?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we can factor out the conjunction with $X,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n(X∧Y)∨(X∧¬Z)≡X∧(Y∨¬Z)\n$$\n\nThen, we can write\n\n$$\nX∧(Y∨¬Z)≡(Y∨¬Z)∧X.\n$$",
