      "dom_id": "step-q86776",
      "name": "Question 17",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(G∨H)∧(¬K∨H)?$",
      "worked_solution": "First, we can factor out the disjunction with $H,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n(G∨H)∧(¬K∨H)≡(G∧¬K)∨H\n$$\n\nThen, we can write\n\n$$\n(G∧¬K)∨H≡H∨(G∧¬K).\n$$",
