      "name": "Question 18",
      "problem": "Which statement is equivalent to $(¬X∨¬Z)∧(¬Y∨¬Z)?$",
      "worked_solution": "We can factor out the disjunction with $¬Z,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n(¬X∨¬Z)∧(¬Y∨¬Z)≡(¬X∧¬Y)∨¬Z\n$$",
